## Interface: 16001
## Title: Tabard
## Notes: A dated record of your guild: who joined, left, was promoted or leveled, alts and mains, a ban list, officer notes, a to-do list, a play-now finder, new members' first week, welcome whispers, raid attendance, export, and sharing between officers. Built for WoW Forever with the stock UI.
